Rootform baseline policy pack
=============================

This directory is a synthetic public example of one Rootform Policy Pack.
It is provided under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The example depends only on the referenced "core" dialect concepts and is
provider-neutral by design: it declares no provider-specific vocabulary and
selects no provider dialect. Policy blocks inside this example never enter a
dialect artifact.

